        "destination_minimum.descr": "Specifies the minimum range cardinality for the destination class if the relationship class is many-to-many or one-to-many.",
        "destination_minimum.title": "Destination Minimum",
        "destination_subtype.descr": "Specifies the subtype of the destination class. If the destination class has subtypes, choose the subtype to which you want to associate a relationship class rule. If the destination class has no subtypes, the relationship rule will apply to all features.",
